# Module

## Package Script Set: Common Scripts

**Scripts:**

- Package Script: Lint
  - Purpose: Check formatting and lint
  - Command: `prettier . -c && eslint .`

- Package Script: Lint Fix
  - Purpose: Fix formatting and lint issues
  - Command: `prettier . -c --write && eslint . --fix`

- Package Script: Test
  - Purpose: Run tests
  - Command: `npm run lint`
